onization of the recovered node.","limitations":["The disruption stopped Patroni/PostgreSQL on node2 but did not simulate complete host loss, loss of node2's etcd member, or a network partition.","Only node2 failure and recovery were exercised; equivalent disruptions of node3 and node4 were not captured.","No reboot test directly verified persistence of the saved routing and enabled HA services."]}
